<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong>Tampa, FL, 8th September 2022:</strong> <a href="/">Teamwork Commerce</a>, a leading omnichannel solution, has announced that it will be exhibiting at <a href="https://en.parisretailweek.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Paris Retail Week</a>, Europe’s largest retail show taking place September 20-22, 2022, and will be demonstrating its latest next-gen solution, POS Pro.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">A hub for professionals from the ecommerce and connected commerce ecosystem, Paris Retail Week will include a great mix of conferences, workshops, pitching, awards, innovation tours, and announcements of new innovations. </p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Located on stand G107, Teamwork Commerce will be exhibiting with its wide range of retail technology offerings as well as its latest solution, POS Pro. The technology provider will offer demonstrations of the advanced solution, detailing how the next-gen technology can help retailers to drive infinite scalability whilst providing a seamless customer experience. </p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Jonathan Mauerer, VP of Operations at Teamwork Commerce said: “Paris Retail Week is a significant opportunity for us to come together with our peers and meet new customers whilst showcasing our latest innovations and learning more about industry trends.”</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">With more than 15,000 professionals and 330 companies over three days, the event is set to bring together industry professionals from across the globe.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Mauerer adds: “Teamwork Commerce has grown exponentially in the last few years, and we’re already gaining recognition in the European and UK markets. We look forward to meeting everyone and spreading awareness about how our technology can drive growth for retailers.”</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Teamwork Commerce’s POS Pro is an advanced tool to modernise in-store and online offerings of retailers and provide ultimate customer experience.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong>About Teamwork Commerce</strong>Teamwork Commerce is a leading Omnichannel Solution, providing retailers with Point-of Sale, Order Management, Inventory Control, CRM and Analytics. They also boast an ecosystem of integrations with top solutions making unified commerce a seamless activity. Serving top retailers in over 20 countries globally including, Acne Studios, The Row, Asics, Princesse Tam Tam, Comptoir des Cotonniers, and Moose Knuckles. Learn more at <a href="http://www.teamworkcommerce.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.teamworkcommerce.fr</a></p>
